At 12 o'clock, I go down to the canteen with a colleague.
We take plates of warm food.
Then we sit down at a table over by the window.
We eat, talk, and laugh together.
We talk about the dark winter weather in Denmark.
"It is good that we have warm coffee," my colleague says and smiles.
I laugh and drink my coffee.
Here at work, we enjoy ourselves a lot.
